  (text "AIRSOFT REACTION TARGETS - hardware v2 (as built)" (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 48b5c300-d1ce-5c24-9b50-15ce69948bd8))
  (text "One hub and up to 5 identical targets. The boards are not wired together: the targets talk to the\nhub over ESP-NOW (WiFi channel 1 by default). Phones join the hub's WiFi and open the app.\nDouble-click a sheet to open it." (at 25.4 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid bd0abba5-286e-5e88-af69-2f5fe8cb1bb8))
